beamtest0809_sim.cc         beamtest simulation (first attempt for beamtest 09/2008)
mppc.cc                     light catcher for a MPPC

beamtest0909_sim.cc         improved beamtest simulation (for beamtest 09/2009) includes also a photon cannon
prototype.cc                beamtest simulation with prism and backward lens options
photTrajectory.cc           debug tool for beamtest0909_sim.cc & prototype.cc (visualization of the photon trajectory)
parTrajectory.cc            debug tool for beamtest0909_sim.cc & prototype.cc (visualization of the particle trajectory)
parameter.cc                debug tool for beamtest0909_sim.cc & prototype.cc (show all used parameters in a ROOT-file)
KBarAnalysis.cc/hh          generates the kBar maps (look-up tables)
run_KBarAnalysis.cc         macro to start the kBar analysis
mcpPos.cc                   display a single MCP on screen (adjustable) and show the hit pixels
mcp4Pos.cc                  advanced mcpPos.cc with pixel-tree
screenPix.cc                pixelization with pixel-tree
recoCherenkovAngle.cc       Cherenkov angle reconstruction from a pixel-tree & kBar-tree
recoCherenkovAngleTrue.cc   Cherenkov angle reconstruction from a beamtest simulation
effiConti.cc                show the separate efficiency contributions for a single beamtest simulation
EffiContiAll.cc/hh          combines different beamtest simulation to show efficiency as a function of incidence angle
run_EffiContiAll.cc         macro to start efficiency analysis
effiContiAllPlot.cc         plot some efficiencies as a function of incidence angle
